    {
      "_id": "CsdvI2PZG2WvBA5v",
      "name": "Alternate Form",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/magic-swirl.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A werewolf can assume wolf or hybrid form, but its gear is not absorbed into the new form. The bipedal hybrid form is about 6 feet tall, with a short tail and thick fur. The legs are like those of a wolf, and the head combines humanoid and lupine features in degrees that vary from one werewolf to the next. The animal form is that of a fully-grown wolf without any trace of human features.</p><p>Changing to or from wolf or hybrid form is a move action. Upon assuming either form, the werewolf regains hit points as if having rested for a day. A slain werewolf reverts to its humanoid form, although it remains dead. Afflicted werewolves find this ability difficult to control (see Lycanthropy as an Affliction, below), but natural lycanthropes have full control over this power.</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/creatures4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.y98NYAYGT9GM5Mox.JournalEntryPage.Gz87IPdigtsYQV9G",
        "abilityType": "supernatural",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!laxCd5AYeKdqMqsT.CsdvI2PZG2WvBA5v"
    },
    {
      "_id": "jO5FwRN2jZ68M1Qr",
      "name": "Curse of Lycanthropy",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/magic-swirl.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Any humanoid hit by a werewolf’s bite attack (in wolf or hybrid form) must succeed on a @Check[save:fort|dc:15]{Fortitude save (DC 15)} or contract lycanthropy.</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/creatures4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.y98NYAYGT9GM5Mox.JournalEntryPage.Gz87IPdigtsYQV9G",
        "abilityType": "supernatural",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!laxCd5AYeKdqMqsT.jO5FwRN2jZ68M1Qr"
    },
    {
      "_id": "n4bi7fhZdOSqUkAb",
      "name": "Trip",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A werewolf in wolf form that hits with a bite attack can attempt to trip its opponent as a free action without making a touch attack or provoking an attack of opportunity. If the attempt fails, the opponent cannot react to trip the werewolf.</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/creatures4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.y98NYAYGT9GM5Mox.JournalEntryPage.Gz87IPdigtsYQV9G",
        "abilityType": "extraordinary",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!laxCd5AYeKdqMqsT.n4bi7fhZdOSqUkAb"
    },
    {
