      "name": "Wolf Empathy",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A werewolf can communicate with wolves in any form and gains a +4 species bonus on @Check[skill:diplomacy]{Diplomacy check}s when influencing a wolf’s attitude. A friendly wolf understands and heeds simple commands, such as “wait,” “chase,” “flee,” and “attack.”</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
